# ArduiTouch 2.4" with an esp-prog JTAG probe attached. Not a fourth board: the
# probe takes GPIO 12-15, which collides with the touch chip select (14) and the
# backlight (15), so those two move to 26 and 16. The control interface comes
# with it: a bench panel is exactly where a scriptable pointer belongs, and the
# probe is what says this build never goes on a wall.
CONFIG_OHEZ_BOARD_ARDUITOUCH=y
CONFIG_OHEZ_ARDUITOUCH_JTAG_PINS=y
CONFIG_OHEZ_TESTIF=y
